#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:5 c9bc97638f9c48d38a2682eebd426ec2
msgid "Plane Architecture Overview"
msgstr "固定翼架构概述"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:7 571290da2d924c18afb513dfdb3a76a2
msgid ""
"This page attempts to roughly show the ArduPlane architecture.  Please note "
"it was not written by Plane experts so there may be some inaccuraies."
msgstr "本页试图大致展示 ArduPlane 的架构。请注意，本文并非由固定翼专家编写，因此可能存在一些不准确之处。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:12
#: 9fef1bd69e984140adc8da113efecb82
msgid ""
"Above is a high level diagram of ArduPlane's architecture.  One large "
"difference between Plane vs Copter and Rover is flight modes are not "
"organised into a single file (:ref:`like they are in Copter <apmcopter-"
"adding-a-new-flight-mode>`) or class (:ref:`like they are in Rover <rover-"
"adding-a-new-drive-mode>`).  Instead the code path goes through stages.  "
"Each stage then decides what it should do based on the flight mode."
msgstr ""
"上图为 ArduPlane 架构的高层次示意图。固定翼与多旋翼和地面车的一个重大区别是，飞行模式不是组织在单个文件（:ref:`像多旋翼那样 "
"<apmcopter-adding-a-new-flight-mode>`）或类（:ref:`像地面车那样 <rover-adding-a-new-"
"drive-mode>`）中的。相反，代码路径通过各个阶段进行。每个阶段再根据飞行模式决定应该做什么。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:14
#: 0ffed27c3ec74690b5541294f261e5b7
msgid "These stages can be seen in the diagram above and include:"
msgstr "这些阶段可在上图中看到，包括："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:16
#: ab566ee2fe3348ffbf0652baa70d17a2
msgid ""
"``ahrs_update`` calls the EKF to consume the latest sensor data and produce "
"a attitude and position estimate."
msgstr "``ahrs_update`` 调用 EKF 处理最新传感器数据，生成姿态和位置估计。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:17
#: ce95e602b7bb4884b9e42f4ff244b8de
msgid ""
"``read_radio`` reads in the pilot's input and calculates the appropriate "
"attitude or position targets"
msgstr "``read_radio`` 读取飞手输入并计算适当的姿态或位置目标"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:18
#: bfc59d91f5e6449c897b3ac016e02d69
msgid ""
"``navigate`` calls the L1 and TECS controllers (see below) to convert "
"position targets for the roll, pitch and throttle controllers"
msgstr "``navigate`` 调用 L1 和 TECS 控制器（见下文），将位置目标转换为横滚、俯仰和油门控制器的输入"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:19
#: 0b6d01c203e64d50856288913a08566e
msgid ""
"``update_control_mode`` copies the L1 controller's roll and pitch targets to"
" nav_roll_cd and nav_pitch_cd global variables"
msgstr ""
"``update_control_mode`` 将 L1 控制器的横滚和俯仰目标复制到全局变量 nav_roll_cd 和 nav_pitch_cd"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:20
#: 2c41f59f715a4dafaebd7ac22b92f2d6
msgid ""
"``stabilize`` executes the lower level roll, pitch and throttle controllers"
msgstr "``stabilize`` 执行底层横滚、俯仰和油门控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:21
#: 39d18112f6504c07804e568c09977c37
msgid ""
"``set_servos`` sends the output from the roll, pitch and throttle "
"controllers to the appropriate servo outputs"
msgstr "``set_servos`` 将横滚、俯仰和油门控制器的输出发送到适当的舵机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:24
#: 68c86fc9e38f4b5b959b68450f519b37
msgid "Plane Controllers"
msgstr "固定翼控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:26
#: 7a9ce006fbd84358a812b9d260f2fb37
msgid ""
"Plane has 2 high level controllers and at least 3 lower level controllers "
"shown below."
msgstr "固定翼有 2 个高层次控制器和至少 3 个如下所示的底层控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:31
#: b1bc649a70db45e4ae3df4b31f354bab
msgid ""
"the L1 controller converts a origin and destination (each expressed as a "
"latitude, longitude) into a lateral acceleration to make the vehicle travel "
"horizontally along the path from the origin to the destination."
msgstr "L1 控制器将起点和终点（均以纬度、经度表示）转换为横向加速度，使飞行器沿从起点到终点的路径水平飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-architecture.rst:32
#: 5ff17bc4695b4171846ffdc198607ec8
msgid ""
"the TECS (Total Energy Conservation System) controls the exchange between "
"the vehicle's kinetic energy (i.e. speed) and its potential energy (i.e. "
"altitude).  Its inputs are a target speed and height and it attempts to "
"reach these targets by calculating target throttle and pitch values which "
"are then passed to the lower level pitch and throttle controllers."
msgstr ""
"TECS（总能量守恒系统）控制飞行器动能（即速度）与势能（即高度）之间的转换。其输入为目标速度和高度，并通过计算目标油门和俯仰值来尝试达到这些目标，然后将其传递给底层俯仰和油门控制器。"
